{15}{Someone managed to open up a sort of a powerful Hellgate, a portal to the demon's world. I do not know why anyone would want to allow demons to pour forth and raze all. I closed the path leading into the village but there is still a way to get there. A mountain pass nearby seems to veer towards the town of Worthington, but I am not sure where it surfaces.}{Someone managed to open up a sort of a powerful Hellgate, a portal to the demon's world. I do not know why anyone would want to allow demons to pour forth and raze all. I closed the path leading into the village but there is still a way to get there. A mountain pass nearby seems to veer towards the town of Worthington, but I am not sure where it surfaces.}{}{}{}{}
