{25}{Shutting down the portal would prevent more demons from coming to this plane. However, you would also need to find whoever opened it in the first place and make sure that he or she will never be able to open another portal again. Are you sure you wish to continue down this road?}{Shutting down the portal would prevent more demons from coming to this plane. However, you would also need to find whoever opened it in the first place and make sure that he or she will never be able to open another portal again. Are you sure you wish to continue down this road?}{}{}{}{qu 1201 1}
