{55}{The village's herbalist somehow heard of me and asked for my help in preparing some sort of medicine. However, I only came to the edge of town before I encountered the demons there. I retreated to this clearing and found that this band had just set up camp. [He looks somber and sad] I saw them die, and there was nothing I could do to help them. Now here you are...}{The village's herbalist somehow heard of me and asked for my help in preparing some sort of medicine. However, I only came to the edge of town before I encountered the demons there. I retreated to this clearing and found that this band had just set up camp. [He looks somber and sad] I saw them die, and there was nothing I could do to help them. Now here you are...}{}{}{}{}
