{65}{[He looks at bit startled at your question.] You mean you wish to confront this evil? Very well "hero." There is a small village in the forest up ahead overrun by demons. There must be a portal somewhere in town. Not only must the portal be shut down, but the one responsible must never be capable of opening another portal! You must find a way to get to town... probably through that mountain pass just south from here.}{[He looks at bit startled at your question.] You mean you wish to confront this evil? Very well "hero." There is a small village in the forest up ahead overrun by demons. There must be a portal somewhere in town. Not only must the portal be shut down, but the one responsible must never be capable of opening another portal! You must find a way to get to town... probably through that mountain pass just south from here.}{}{}{}{qu 1201 1}
